UID:7d8d6d211f680aaf0a31efab55bc664810292026_12:42:01_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Show solidarity and share some encouragement this holiday seas
 on! Join fellow Underground Scholars for a card-making session to support 
 students working toward their college education while incarcerated. Many o
 f these scholars are working hard to transfer to universities upon release
 \, and receiving a personal card during the holidays can make a huge diffe
 rence in lifting their spirits. Supplies\, music\, and good company provid
 ed—come hang out\, write a few words of encouragement\, and build commun
 ity!
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909875
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
