SUMMARY:Open House: Meet the Up-and-Coming scientists in entomology
DESCRIPTION:This free\, public open house will feature graduate student and undergraduate researchers at UC Davis and the cool research that they are doing. Meet the up-and-coming entomologists\, see the insect collection\, hold live insects and do a fun craft. Parking is free in lot 46 and lot 47 near the museum.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/open-house-meet-the-up-and-coming-scientists-in-entomology/
LOCATION:Bohart Museum of Entomology (Bohart Museum)\, 1124 Academic Surge\, UC Davis Campus
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Community,Science
