DESCRIPTION:Join SCB-D in upcycling cardboard and paper materials to make 
 enrichment toys for residents at the raptor center! There will also be tim
 e to visit the display birds. Please bring any supplies you have including
  scissors\, cardboard rolls\, boxes\, or egg cartons.\n\nWhere: California
  Raptor Center (1340 Equine Ln)\nWhen: November 14th\, 10:00-11:30 AM\n\nT
 ransportation notes: Since the CRC is close to campus\, we will not be pro
 viding carpool. There are bike racks onsite and paid parking. To avoid veh
 icle parking fees\, there is a free parking lot down the road at 38°31'04
 .61"N 121°45'23.47"W.
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909885
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
