SUMMARY:Women's Health Game Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T203000
UID:9e074cf664e7a03309f7e058d0f16b8c10102026_1:28:31_AM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a game night\, an interactive event where students
  learn about women's health through trivia covering reproductive health\, 
 anatomy\, nutrition\, and myths vs. facts. Our main activity is a case stu
 dy challenge\, led by Liz Oleson\, NP\, where teams work through fictional
  patient cases\, identify possible diagnoses\, and learn the clinical reas
 oning behind each answer from a healthcare professional. Come test your kn
 owledge\, learn something new\, and have fun with fellow HerScope members!
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909586
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
