UID:ef8b914d86e99bd3affd64776841a3d810272026_5:26:40_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Rage is powerful\, and you don't have to carry it alone. Join 
 us on Tuesday\, November 24th from 4-5:30pm for a community-centered space
  focused on expressing feminine rage\, releasing frustration\, building co
 mmunity\, and embracing anger as a source of insight\, power\, and connect
 ion. This space is for UC Davis students.\n\nimage description: red flier 
 with picture of angry egghead yelling at another egghead. All information 
 above is on the flier.
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909859
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
